STARTFONT 2.1
FONT -wenquanyi-wenquanyi bitmap song-bold-r-normal--16-160-75-75-P-80-iso10646-1
COMMENT ==========================================================
COMMENT                Wen Quan Yi Bitmap Song
COMMENT ----------------------------------------------------------
COMMENT Summary:
COMMENT
COMMENT         Authors  : The WenQuanYi Project Contributors
COMMENT         Webpage  : http://wqy.sourceforge.net/en/
COMMENT         Font Name: WenQuanYi Bitmap Song
COMMENT         Version  : 0.9.9 (1.0 beta) [Hero]
COMMENT         Release  : 8
COMMENT         Copyright: (C)2004-2007, The WenQuanYi Project
COMMENT                    Board of Trustees and Qianqian Fang
COMMENT         License  : GPL v2.0 (with font embedding exception)
COMMENT
COMMENT           May the Font be with you, forever!
COMMENT ----------------------------------------------------------
COMMENT The Wen Quan Yi bitmap font is a manually fine-tuned
COMMENT multi-strike bitmap font for on-screen display of Chinese
COMMENT (traditional and simplified). It has arguably the most complete
COMMENT coverage for Chinese characters among all known open-source
COMMENT fonts, including CJK Unified Ideograph (U4E00 - U9FA5) and
COMMENT CJK Unified Ideograph Extension A (U3400 - U4DB5) glyphs
COMMENT at four different sizes (9pt-12X12 pixel, 10pt-13X13 pixel,
COMMENT 11pt-15X15 pixel, 12pt-16x16 pixel) and two weights 
COMMENT (medium and bold). Use this font in web pages and elsewhere 
COMMENT eliminates the annoying "blurring" problems caused by 
COMMENT the high stroke density of many Chinese characters and 
COMMENT insufficient "hinting" of anti-aliased Chinese fonts. 
COMMENT This font also provides bitmap glyphs for Basic Latin,
COMMENT Japanese Hiragana (U3040 - U309F) and Katakana (U30A0 - U30FF).
COMMENT ----------------------------------------------------------
COMMENT Project starting date       2004/10/26
COMMENT CJK Basic completed on      2005/4/10
COMMENT CJK Ext A completed on      2006/7/22
COMMENT CJK Basic character total   20902
COMMENT CJK Ext A character total   6582 
COMMENT Total glyphs from firefly   15832 X 3 sizes
COMMENT New glyphs                  15210 + 6582*4=41538
COMMENT Improved glyph number       > 50,000
COMMENT Webspace providers          wenq.org,Dartmouth CSSA,sourceforge,lwfs.net
COMMENT
COMMENT Core members                FangQ,caiqian,fundawang,wanghong,tchaikov
COMMENT                             ailantian, niqiu, fiag, ZaiJianQingRen
COMMENT Team B members              ailantian,activeion,amadeoh,BabyPBC,BenBear,
COMMENT                             brep,chaoslawful,DannyZeng,farm,fiag,keykeen,
COMMENT                             liyi,lucifer,nilarcs,niqiu,pangwa,pathfinder,
COMMENT                             pinker,PONY,pupilzeng,shhky,stid,wuler.lv,
COMMENT                             xnuxmwx,namespace,leftstand,MarkLam,buick,
COMMENT                             liqian,qinling,Seeker,xiaoma,ZaiJianQingRen,
COMMENT                             SiCengXiangShi,the_owl,whppc,eka,failsafe,
COMMENT                             musiccow,Blueelf,lenovox,udi,leal,hzhsun
COMMENT ----------------------------------------------------------
COMMENT This file: WenQuanYi Bitmap Song 12pt bold
COMMENT Created by Qianqian Fang (fangq #nmr _mgh _harvard _edu)
COMMENT ----------------------------------------------------------
